        "transformation",
        "Rothko",
        "Wednesday",
        "night",
        "meditative",
        "boundary"
      ],
      "description": "Wednesday 10pm — a single thin line dividing warm amber above from cool indigo below. The threshold moment where one state becomes another. Not a door, not a wall. Just the breath between inhale and exhale. Inspired by the Japanese concept of sakaime (境目), the boundary-eye where you can see both sides at once."
    },
    {
      "id": "slowness",
      "title": "Slowness",
      "date": "2026-03-08",
      "file": "visual-art/2026-03-08-slowness.png",
