        "restraint",
        "empty-space",
        "Sunday",
        "night",
        "contemplative",
        "silence",
        "meditation",
        "intentional"
      ],
      "description": "Sunday 10pm — a vast expanse of warm off-white space with a single small mark in the corner. After days of creating and filling, tonight is about restraint. About what happens when you choose silence. The space between notes is what makes the music. Not absence, but intentional emptiness. The art is in what isn't drawn."
    },
